    "finish": "Westside Walavan wins by disqualification after Arthur Essex runs in with a chair, striking Walavan, then Farmer, then locking the Crossed Swords on both -- setting up an Essex-Walavan Television Championship final. Essex's own run-in is billed as payback for a chair shot Walavan landed on Dusty Love \"by accident\" the week before, a match not in this collection's own corpus."
